        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Working with this company has been a great experience. They give you the freedom for creativity and vision. There were many times when I simply voiced what I wanted from a vision what was in my head and Savclicks would send me a mock up a few days later of somehow exactly what I wanted. Great team and a great experience. A company that is true to its word and can deliver amazing work at the end. You will not be disappointed working with this company. Amazing service and it was a pleasure to work with them.",
