        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6HrphRn6n5TQMtQ_HnivGYGQhXpfiACNC1cmgFYArhgFnfg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Had a fantastic experience with SavClicks. Super professional, easy to work with, and really knows his stuff. Communication was clear from start to finish and the results spoke for themselves. Highly recommend them if you’re looking for quality work you can trust!",
