      {
        "author_name": "Diva Menke-Thielman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105823561544107926029/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUTUON5n9q0KZ2L7qPk3hS5n1e2-S5GxmR12d7HdqkbMjxUDoQ1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Saverio completely transformed our website. Our old site had no SEO, so we were getting very little traffic. Luckily for us, SEO is his specialty. He was patient, kind, and went above and beyond with all our requests.\n\nIf you’re a small service-based business wanting to boost traffic without overspending, hire him. He’s skilled, reliable, and delivers exceptional value. We’re thrilled with the results, and you will be too!",
        "time": 1764108283,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Angelica Dalaroy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110103772490038330464/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJMrw2gALOdx5-ekogXz-IAHb9XzLZqjOVAJsujKr8zXIBuEw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I was referred  to Saverio owner of SavClicks to build my website after a few attempts at trying to find a web designer that was truly interested in understanding my domain as a health and wellness practitioner.  Saverio dedicated a lot of time to helping me build a website that represented my business and the message I wanted to convey to attract the clients I wanted to target.  Not only  was patient and resourceful but he made suggestions to my benefit.  I would highly recommend hiring him.\n.",
